        "Date of issue, and date of supply where different",
        "Description of the goods or services supplied",
        "Per line: unit price, quantity, tax rate, amount payable in AED",
        "Discounts shown separately",
        "Gross amount payable in AED",
        "Tax amount in AED, with the exchange rate and its source where converted",
